%F A099072 a(n) = A073359(n) - A073359(n-1) for n > 1. - _Bill McEachen_, Dec 22 2024; corrected by _Qiyuan Gu_, Sep 12 2026; proved in Leonov (2026) - _Andrei Leonov_, Oct 07 2026
%t A099072 del[lst_, k_] := lst[[ Select[ Range[ Length[ lst]], Mod[ #, k] != 0 &]]]; For[ k = 2; s = Range[10000], k <= Length[s], k++, s = del[s, k]]; (Drop[s, 1] - Drop[s, -1])/2
